The story tells us that the yellow square is under a medium blue square (which is square 2). Square 2 therefore is above the yellow square. Square 1 is described as being over (above) square 2. By transitivity, if square 1 is above square 2 and square 2 is above the yellow square, then square 1 is also above the yellow square.

Thus, medium blue square number one is **above** the yellow shape.

{"answer": "above"}
